<!--
  Notification small icon: the club's maple-leaf mark as a flat white
  silhouette, which is the only thing Android will render here. It tints the
  shape with default_notification_color and ignores every colour in the file,
  so this is deliberately monochrome rather than the launcher icon shrunk down
  (that produces the grey blob you see in badly built apps).

  Same path data as the brand mark in src/components/portal/PortalShell.tsx.
  Scaled to 0.82 because a notification icon needs its own padding: Android
  gives the drawable no margin and an edge-to-edge shape reads as a smudge at
  status-bar size.
-->
